WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.353 --> 00:00:02.970
(bright music)

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.410
There's no place like home.

3
00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:09.200
And for chef Nik Fields, that's Phoenix, Arizona.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.590
Where one of her passions is highlighting local business.

5
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.450
Ours is too Nik!

6
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.583
And watch this very special hometown tour.

7
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.260
Hi Drew it's chef Nik.

8
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.540
I'm here at Arizona's family studios in Phoenix, Arizona.

9
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.910 line:15%
One of the things I love about my hometown of Phoenix, is it

10
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.200
