11
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.583
Come on, let me show you.

12
00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:33.350
Welcome to Tempe beach park.

13
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:36.820 line:15%
You have people that are riding their bikes, people walking,

14
00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.250 line:15%
