17
00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.800
We're here at the beautiful Desert Botanical Garden.

18
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.220 line:15%
I love this place because I used to take my daughter here

19
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.430 line:15%
