20
00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:56.610 line:15%
They have the most beautiful butterflies, and they have over

21
00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.750
50,000 types of plants.

22
00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.180
We are here with Dana, the director of marketing.

23
00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:02.450
Dana, can you tell us a little bit

24
00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:04.510
