34
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.810 line:15%
But also home of my favorite dessert, the root beer float.

35
00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.440
Oh my God, It's so yummy.

36
00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.980
Howard, what makes Mary Coyle's so special?

37
00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.810
Why should people visit here?

38
00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:34.780
Well, for one thing,

39
00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.120
