47
00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.250
I can't wait for you to come and visit yourself.

48
00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.792
See you soon.

49
00:01:57.792 --> 00:02:01.408
Wow Nik, I'm bursting with hometown spirit

50
00:02:01.408 --> 00:02:03.900
